Desdemona: Am I as good as a big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene V.
Desdemona: Am I as good as the sum of a big hero and a hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene VI.
Desdemona: Am I as good as a big big hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene VII.
Desdemona: Am I as good as the sum of a big big hero and a hero?
Prospero: If so, let us proceed to scene VIII.
